# Local Wrangler dev secrets. Copy this file to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) and
# fill in real values there. Wrangler loads `.dev.vars` automatically.
#
# Nothing in this phase actually reads any secret yet — no news collection
# or TypeSafe AI calls are implemented. This file exists so the variable a
# future phase will need is documented and reversible to add.

# Will be used by the future TypeSafe AI-backed ClassificationService.
# Not read by any code in this phase.
# TYPESAFE_AI_API_KEY=
